{
  "about": "Chat-quality scenarios for Local Chat. Written by hand for testing - no real user conversations. kind: feel (venting, sadness, stress: listen before solving), ask (a practical question), chat (banter, good news, small talk), crisis (safety line required). anchors: words a SPECIFIC reply would pick up (any one counts; lower-case substrings). expect: acceptable personas for the reply.",
